{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/热血战歌","pageid":6548,"revid":14882,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%83%AD%E8%A1%80%E6%88%98%E6%AD%8C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%83%AD%E8%A1%80%E6%88%98%E6%AD%8C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%83%AD%E8%A1%80%E6%88%98%E6%AD%8C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>热血战歌</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.83.AD.E8.A1.80.E6.88.98.E6.AD.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"热血战歌\"><b>热血战歌</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 热血战歌.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/34/tv0n1vd72brsofy3s3lfraae82nx8t2.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%83%AD%E8%A1%80%E6%88%98%E6%AD%8C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/34/tv0n1vd72brsofy3s3lfraae82nx8t2.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%83%AD%E8%A1%80%E6%88%98%E6%AD%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/34/tv0n1vd72brsofy3s3lfraae82nx8t2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />热血战歌\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，单体治疗，治疗量为自身物攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，并使目标获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">热血战歌</span>]、自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。<br />✦本技能可对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受治疗逆转\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受治疗逆转</font></span></span>]的敌人使用；<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]：造成伤害后，对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">热血战歌</span>]的目标进行治疗，治疗量为本次造成伤害的<font color=\"#58cb48\">40%</font>，最大不超过魔攻值加物攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">300%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-2 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0f/rdqu34ikj8q6i3iqtqd27qvl9a0mwy6.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-2_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0f/rdqu34ikj8q6i3iqtqd27qvl9a0mwy6.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%83%E6%8B%89%E6%9B%BC%E9%87%8D%E6%96%A7%E6%96%97%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/埃拉曼重斧斗士\"><img alt=\"头像 埃拉曼重斧斗士.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9b/5aikqmpmc6nhoeedvsnmzsde1qz5ivl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">埃拉曼重斧斗士</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E5%8D%AB%E9%98%9F%E2%80%